{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201370/extras/two-2.png?t=1744368185\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>ON ANY JOURNEY</i></strong> is a cooperative adventure game which emphasizes teamwork, requiring players to collaborate closely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Success depends on effective communication and coordination among players. The game encourages players to think about these themes as they navigate the characters' journey, making it a meaningful and introspective experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201370/extras/\u53cc\u4eba.gif?t=1744368185\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201370/extras/narrative.png?t=1744368185\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will guide Mateo and Kai, who grew up in an ordinary town. They felt the weight of their differences, which made them feel shy and inferior. In a bid to fit in, they made a wish and embarked on a challenging adventure, hoping to make their wishes come true.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout this adventure, they grappled with various changes and doubts, their hearts aching with uncertainty. In the end, they discovered the beauty in their differences and managed to salvage their precious friendship that was on the brink of being lost.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201370/extras/\u8e22.gif?t=1744368185\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201370/extras/styles.png?t=1744368185\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features beautiful hand-painted environments that offer players an immersive experience. <strong>ON ANY JOURNEY</strong> isn\u2019t just about gameplay\u2014it's a reflection on personal growth, the importance of embracing one\u2019s identity, and the value of friendship. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201370/extras/\u5730\u7262.gif?t=1744368185\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201370/extras/arcade.png?t=1744368185\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember those afternoons crammed into smoky arcades, cheering with friends after every epic combo? <strong>ON ANY JOURNEY</strong> brings that raw, nostalgic thrill straight to your screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game smashes together the best of <strong>bullet hell shooters</strong> and <strong>side-scrolling beat 'em ups</strong>\u2014all wrapped in modern flair.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201370/extras/\u5f39\u5e55.gif?t=1744368185\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201370/extras/\u522b\u72b9\u8c6b\u4e86.png?t=1744368185\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3201370?t=1744368185","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3201370?t=1744368185","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201370/29cd3437d1cd4c919de7e5ad9ad81bef9dbc0d6f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744368185","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201370/29cd3437d1cd4c919de7e5ad9ad81bef9dbc0d6f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744368185","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201370/extras/two-2.png?t=1744368185\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>ON ANY JOURNEY</i></strong> is a cooperative adventure game which emphasizes teamwork, requiring players to collaborate closely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Success depends on effective communication and coordination among players. The game encourages players to think about these themes as they navigate the characters' journey, making it a meaningful and introspective experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201370/extras/\u53cc\u4eba.gif?t=1744368185\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201370/extras/narrative.png?t=1744368185\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players will guide Mateo and Kai, who grew up in an ordinary town. They felt the weight of their differences, which made them feel shy and inferior. In a bid to fit in, they made a wish and embarked on a challenging adventure, hoping to make their wishes come true.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout this adventure, they grappled with various changes and doubts, their hearts aching with uncertainty. In the end, they discovered the beauty in their differences and managed to salvage their precious friendship that was on the brink of being lost.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201370/extras/\u8e22.gif?t=1744368185\" /></p><p class=